# A one-metre cube, centred on its own origin.
#
# This is not Synty art and has no licence attached to it. It is here so
# that the converter half of the pipeline can be proved on a machine that
# has Blender and no packs: see docs/ART_PIPELINE.md, "Proving the
# converter". It is laid out the way a bought asset is — a pack
# directory, a Source Files tree, a texture beside it — so that resolving
# it exercises the same path a real asset takes.
mtllib unit_cube.mtl
o unit_cube
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
usemtl checker
f 1/1 3/2 4/3 2/4
f 5/1 6/2 8/3 7/4
f 1/1 2/2 6/3 5/4
f 3/1 7/2 8/3 4/4
f 1/1 5/2 7/3 3/4
f 2/1 4/2 8/3 6/4
